NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MANABAR4"] = "The amount of happiness your pet currently has. Content pets inflict normal damage on their enemies, whereas Happy pets inflict enhanced damage, and unhappy pets inflict reduced damage. Happiness goes down when your pet dies or as it grows hungry, while feeding your pet will increase its happiness."
NS.GlobalStrings["NEWBIE_TOOLTIP_MEMORY"] = "How much memory your AddOns are using. You can get to the addon management page from the character select screen."
